{"2662070": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Unwell", "steam_appid": 2662070, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4814980], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2662070/extras/06b3d2db80bb6acf2a12e619e46f230b.poster.avif?t=1787503805\" width=620 height=185 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2662070/extras/06b3d2db80bb6acf2a12e619e46f230b.webm?t=1787503805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Descend into your fractured mind.<br>Face what you’ve lost.<br>Or become what remains.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Unwell</i> is a psychological survival horror where every step deeper is a step closer to the truth -or to your end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Gabriel, a man shattered by loss. After a night that should have ended everything, you awaken at the edge of a vast well -and choose to descend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What waits below is not a place, but what remains of you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each layer reflects a part of your psyche -twisted, hostile, and alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The deeper you go, the closer you are to the moment that broke you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2662070/extras/add2c6ba8881559c4a7092bf0a123861.poster.avif?t=1787503805\" width=620 height=183 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2662070/extras/add2c6ba8881559c4a7092bf0a123861.webm?t=1787503805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>YOUR MIND IS NOT YOUR ALLY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are not alone in the dark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fragments of your mind have taken form:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A primal force that wants you to survive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A buried conscience waiting to be freed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And you -caught in between.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choices will decide which parts of you deserve to live.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2662070/extras/1cf380117386bf45f9665bf330b23c16.poster.avif?t=1787503805\" width=620 height=185 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2662070/extras/1cf380117386bf45f9665bf330b23c16.webm?t=1787503805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DESCEND THROUGH THE DEPTHS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey through symbolic layers of the human psyche -from courage to shame.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level introduces new threats, new mechanics, and new interpretations of your inner state:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face manifestations of fear, desire, anger, and guilt</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive environments that reflect your mental collapse</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover what really happened -and what you’ve been hiding</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2662070/extras/3683d1daa7dc292ce4fefbf69bb13aef.poster.avif?t=1787503805\" width=620 height=198 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2662070/extras/3683d1daa7dc292ce4fefbf69bb13aef.webm?t=1787503805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SURVIVE THE CYCLES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are not safe -even when you stop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fortify your shelter.<br>Prepare for what comes in the dark.<br>Hold the line against what follows you down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seal breaches. Manage limited resources. Survive what tries to break in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every night is a test of your planning, your resources, and your will to continue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2662070/extras/767c23b49fb705236f44e04a517a4788.poster.avif?t=1787503805\" width=620 height=187 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2662070/extras/767c23b49fb705236f44e04a517a4788.webm?t=1787503805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CHOOSE HOW YOU SURVIVE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sneak past threats, distract them, or confront them directly.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage limited resources and inventory</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt your approach to each encounter</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decide when to fight -and when to run</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your behavior shapes more than survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2662070/extras/625701d30ca7105150000ed16c8296ef.poster.avif?t=1787503805\" width=620 height=189 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2662070/extras/625701d30ca7105150000ed16c8296ef.webm?t=1787503805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>YOUR CHOICES HAVE CONSEQUENCES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no single ending.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What you do -and what you refuse to face -will determine Gabriel’s fate.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you destroy parts of yourself to survive?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you confront the truth?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or will you let the darkness take you completely?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2662070/extras/56496c1365adc1e04520e2d0deab4f43.poster.avif?t=1787503805\" width=620 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2662070/extras/56496c1365adc1e04520e2d0deab4f43.webm?t=1787503805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>INSPIRED BY PSYCHOLOGY, NOT DEFINED BY IT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Unwell</i> draws inspiration from psychological theories of the human mind, but tells a story you don’t need to study to understand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not about knowledge.<br>This is about what you feel -and what you choose to do with it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The deeper you go, the less of you remains.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2662070/extras/06b3d2db80bb6acf2a12e619e46f230b.poster.avif?t=1787503805\" width=620 height=185 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2662070/extras/06b3d2db80bb6acf2a12e619e46f230b.webm?t=1787503805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Descend into your fractured mind.<br>Face what you’ve lost.<br>Or become what remains.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Unwell</i> is a psychological survival horror where every step deeper is a step closer to the truth -or to your end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Gabriel, a man shattered by loss. After a night that should have ended everything, you awaken at the edge of a vast well -and choose to descend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What waits below is not a place, but what remains of you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each layer reflects a part of your psyche -twisted, hostile, and alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The deeper you go, the closer you are to the moment that broke you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2662070/extras/add2c6ba8881559c4a7092bf0a123861.poster.avif?t=1787503805\" width=620 height=183 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2662070/extras/add2c6ba8881559c4a7092bf0a123861.webm?t=1787503805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>YOUR MIND IS NOT YOUR ALLY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are not alone in the dark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fragments of your mind have taken form:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A primal force that wants you to survive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A buried conscience waiting to be freed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And you -caught in between.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choices will decide which parts of you deserve to live.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2662070/extras/1cf380117386bf45f9665bf330b23c16.poster.avif?t=1787503805\" width=620 height=185 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2662070/extras/1cf380117386bf45f9665bf330b23c16.webm?t=1787503805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DESCEND THROUGH THE DEPTHS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey through symbolic layers of the human psyche -from courage to shame.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level introduces new threats, new mechanics, and new interpretations of your inner state:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face manifestations of fear, desire, anger, and guilt</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive environments that reflect your mental collapse</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover what really happened -and what you’ve been hiding</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2662070/extras/3683d1daa7dc292ce4fefbf69bb13aef.poster.avif?t=1787503805\" width=620 height=198 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2662070/extras/3683d1daa7dc292ce4fefbf69bb13aef.webm?t=1787503805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SURVIVE THE CYCLES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are not safe -even when you stop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fortify your shelter.<br>Prepare for what comes in the dark.<br>Hold the line against what follows you down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seal breaches. Manage limited resources. Survive what tries to break in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every night is a test of your planning, your resources, and your will to continue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2662070/extras/767c23b49fb705236f44e04a517a4788.poster.avif?t=1787503805\" width=620 height=187 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2662070/extras/767c23b49fb705236f44e04a517a4788.webm?t=1787503805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CHOOSE HOW YOU SURVIVE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sneak past threats, distract them, or confront them directly.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage limited resources and inventory</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt your approach to each encounter</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decide when to fight -and when to run</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your behavior shapes more than survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2662070/extras/625701d30ca7105150000ed16c8296ef.poster.avif?t=1787503805\" width=620 height=189 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2662070/extras/625701d30ca7105150000ed16c8296ef.webm?t=1787503805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>YOUR CHOICES HAVE CONSEQUENCES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no single ending.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What you do -and what you refuse to face -will determine Gabriel’s fate.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you destroy parts of yourself to survive?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you confront the truth?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or will you let the darkness take you completely?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2662070/extras/56496c1365adc1e04520e2d0deab4f43.poster.avif?t=1787503805\" width=620 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2662070/extras/56496c1365adc1e04520e2d0deab4f43.webm?t=1787503805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>INSPIRED BY PSYCHOLOGY, NOT DEFINED BY IT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Unwell</i> draws inspiration from psychological theories of the human mind, but tells a story you don’t need to study to understand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not about knowledge.<br>This is about what you feel -and what you choose to do with it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The deeper you go, the less of you remains.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Descend into your own broken mind in this psychological survival horror. Survive twisted manifestations of your psyche, defend your shelter, and shape your fate through choices that lead to multiple endings.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Polish<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "reviews": "“There is an atmosphere so thick in the Unwell game that I felt my hair stand up on end. The strangest thing is that I have been bald for fifteen years. There is something to look forward to!”<br />\r\nWulgarny Gracz<br />\r\n<br />\r\n“The atmosphere is so thick you could cut it with a knife. Horror and isometric perspective play so well in Unwell that they’ll raise anyone’s blood pressure!”<br />\r\nGraLiq<br />\r\n<br />\r\n“The cryptic story and dark aura combine to create a unique, intriguing, and peculiar (in a good way) experience.”<br />\r\nPan Dibbler<br />\r\n", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2662070/2847689dd18171d09fec0ca96f3a8782cf93c9fc/header.jpg?t=1787503805", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2662070/52c8b91cb0fbb8b77e0478e1b3d44a83689e4ffd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787503805", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2662070/52c8b91cb0fbb8b77e0478e1b3d44a83689e4ffd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787503805", "website": "https://anaesthetic.pl", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel(R) Core(TM) i5-1135G7<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel(R) Iris(R) Xe Graphics<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 6 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Integrated Sound Card</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong>  Intel Core i5-13600KF<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce 1060 <br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 6 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Integrated Sound Card</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Anaesthetic"], "publishers": ["Anaesthetic"], "demos": [{"appid": 2710890, "descrip